# CP0 — repo bootstrap and spec freeze.
# Covers CP0, CP0.1 (spec amendments A8-A21) and CP0.2 (A22-A32, DECISIONS.md).
#
# Format, as consumed by scripts/gate.sh:
#   - one path per line
#   - a trailing "/" makes the entry a directory prefix
#   - anything else is an exact path
#   - blank lines and #-comments are ignored

SPEC.md
PLAN.md
PRIORS.md
README.md
DECISIONS.md
CLAUDE.md
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.env.example
requirements.txt
